        {
          "title": "Leave your net",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap the NET header to open <strong>Select net</strong>, then <strong>Leave</strong> beside your net. You stop talking in it at once.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/83a97b2dc0fcc1c1.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2842
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Undo a mistake",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>For five seconds, <strong>Undo</strong> joins the same net again. The nets you listen to stay as they are.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/942032f323a79db2.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2842
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Join again to talk",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Your talk is off and the PTT reads <strong>JOIN A NET</strong>. Tap the <strong>NET</strong> header and join a net to talk again.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/caf052367c18fb4f.webp",
